.TH CANDLEWIN 1 "November 2026" "candlewin" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
candlewin \- a small frameless candle chart window for Windows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B candlewin.exe
[\fB\-\-server\fR \fIHOST:PORT\fR] [\fB\-\-pair\fR \fINAME\fR] [\fB\-\-tf\fR \fIFRAME\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B candlewin
shows the candles and last price of one coin, from a
.BR candled (8)
server, in a 200 by 200 pixel window with no frame, border or title bar that stays on top of other windows.  It
refreshes once a second.  If a position (an entry price and a size) is entered, it shows the profit or loss as a percentage and
in dollars, green when ahead and red when behind, and draws the entry price as a dotted line.
.SS Keyboard and focus
The window never takes the keyboard by itself.  Click it (and drag to move it) to give it the keyboard; a blue border shows that it
has it.  Move the mouse out of the window and it gives the keyboard back at once to the window that had it (except while an entry or
size is being typed).
.TP
.B Up, Down
the timeframe: 1m 3m 5m 15m 30m 1h 4h 1d 1w.
.TP
.B Left, Right
the coin, in the order the server lists them.
.TP
.B e
type the entry price; Enter accepts, Esc cancels.
.TP
.B s
type the size in coins (negative for a short).
.TP
.B Delete
clear the position of this coin.
.TP
.B t
hide the window in the tray.
.TP
.B + , \-
make the window larger or smaller (75% to 400%).
.TP
.B x
exit.
.TP
.B Esc
give the keyboard back.
.SS Tray and Alt-Tab
A tray icon shows or hides the window with a click; its menu has Exit.  Ctrl+Alt+C does the same from anywhere.  While shown the
window is in Alt\-Tab and has a taskbar button, which minimizes it.  A window hidden in the tray is not in Alt\-Tab: use the icon
or Ctrl+Alt+C.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-server " HOST:PORT"
the server (also kept in the settings file).
.TP
.BI \-\-pair " NAME" ", " \-\-tf " FRAME"
start with this coin and timeframe.
.TP
.BI \-\-shot " FILE.bmp"
draw once and write the picture to a file, then exit (for testing; with \fB\-\-shot\-position\fR \fIENTRY,SIZE\fR and \fB\-\-shot\-active\fR).
.SH FILES
.TP
.B %APPDATA%\\candlewin\\candlewin.ini
settings; see
.BR candlewin (5).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR candled (8),
.BR candlewin (5)
